[{"text": "I now give the floor to his royal", "start": 2.08, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "highness prince Abdul Matin, Minister of", "start": 4.48, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "Foreign Affairs of Brunam.", "start": 7.52, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "Rahim, Mr. President, Mr. Secretary", "start": 30.8, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "General, excellencies,", "start": 34.48, "duration": 6.52}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen.", "start": 37.36, "duration": 3.64}, {"text": "I wish to begin by conveying the warm", "start": 43.36, "duration": 7.56}, {"text": "greetings of his majesty sultan", "start": 45.28, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "sultan and young deuan of salam to this", "start": 51.76, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "esteemed assembly.", "start": 54.719, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "I also congratulate his excellency", "start": 56.96, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Dr. Khalil Rahman on his election as", "start": 60.32, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "president of the 81st session of the", "start": 63.52, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "general assembly and thank her", "start": 66.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "excellency Anelina Berbok for", "start": 68.799, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "outstanding leadership during the 80th", "start": 71.04, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "session.", "start": 73.439, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "My appreciation also extends to", "start": 75.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Secretary General Antonio Gutierrez for", "start": 77.759, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "his continued service to this", "start": 80.88, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 82.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Mr. President, the theme of the session", "start": 84.96, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "speaks directly to something the world", "start": 88.08, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "is losing far too quickly. Trust.", "start": 90.88, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "It's difficult to build, easy to", "start": 95.119, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "fracture, and once lost, very hard to", "start": 97.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "restore.", "start": 100.0, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Without it, treaties risk becoming", "start": 101.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "little more than words.", "start": 103.84, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Institutions become arenas for", "start": 106.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "accusation, and countries increasingly", "start": 108.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "feel compelled to rely only on", "start": 111.6, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "themselves.", "start": 113.36, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "At a time of profound transformation,", "start": 115.6, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "rebuilding confidence among nations lets", "start": 118.399, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "us confront change and uncertainty", "start": 121.119, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "together.", "start": 123.04, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "Today, we not only see declining", "start": 125.119, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "confidence between countries, but a grow", "start": 127.439, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "also a growing crisis of faith in the", "start": 130.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "rules meant to bind us together.", "start": 132.64, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "When nations begin to believe that rules", "start": 135.92, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "are applied differently depending on", "start": 138.239, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "power or circumstance, the instinct is", "start": 140.319, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "to turn inward and act alone.", "start": 143.52, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "That weakens us all. Dialogue becomes", "start": 146.72, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "harder, multilateral institutions lose", "start": 149.76, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "authority, and the international order", "start": 152.959, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "becomes more fragile, leaving smaller", "start": 155.84, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and more vulnerable states particularly", "start": 158.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "exposed.", "start": 160.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "For Bernard Salam, multilateralism is", "start": 163.28, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "not an intellectual concept. It is", "start": 166.16, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "assurance that sovereignty", "start": 169.12, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "and territorial integrity will be", "start": 171.28, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "respected. That every nation,", "start": 173.2, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "irrespective of size, has a voice, and", "start": 175.92, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "that international law protects the weak", "start": 179.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "as surely as it restrains the strong.", "start": 181.84, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "The charter of the United Nations must", "start": 185.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "therefore remain our common foundation.", "start": 187.68, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "It cannot mean one thing in one crisis", "start": 191.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "and something different in another.", "start": 193.599, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Its principles must be upheld", "start": 196.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "consistently if this organization is to", "start": 198.239, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "retain its legitimacy and credibility.", "start": 201.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Few issues demonstrate this more", "start": 206.319, "duration": 3.121}, {"text": "painfully than the question of", "start": 207.76, "duration": 3.199}, {"text": "Palestine.", "start": 209.44, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "For generations, the Palestinian people", "start": 210.959, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "have waited for justice, statehood, and", "start": 213.44, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "dignity.", "start": 216.48, "duration": 3.119}, {"text": "They cannot be asked to wait", "start": 218.4, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "indefinitely for rights that are already", "start": 219.599, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "theirs.", "start": 222.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "In Gaza, the scale of human suffering", "start": 224.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and destruction is intolerable.", "start": 226.72, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Civilians, including far too many", "start": 229.84, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "children, continue to bear the heaviest", "start": 232.159, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "costs.", "start": 234.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Medics, journalists, humanitarian", "start": 236.48, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "workers, and United Nations personnel", "start": 239.68, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "have also lost their lives while", "start": 242.159, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "carrying out their duties.", "start": 244.159, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "This suffering cannot become normal. In", "start": 246.64, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "the West Bank, Palestinians continue to", "start": 249.36, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "endure occupation, expanding illegal", "start": 251.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "settlements, settle violence, and", "start": 254.239, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "displacement from their homes and land.", "start": 257.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Whether in Gaza or the West Bank, these", "start": 260.0, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "are not merely numbers. They are human", "start": 262.88, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "lives.", "start": 264.96, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "And their suffering exposes a", "start": 266.96, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "fundamental truth. International law and", "start": 268.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the principles of the charter must apply", "start": 271.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "equally to everyone.", "start": 273.68, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "There cannot be one standard for some", "start": 276.24, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "and another for others.", "start": 278.479, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "A just and lasting peace therefore", "start": 281.199, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "requires more than managing the", "start": 283.36, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "consequences of conflict.", "start": 284.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "It requires addressing its root cause", "start": 287.919, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "and realizing the Palestinian people's", "start": 290.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "legitimate right to self-determination", "start": 291.759, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "and an independent state of Palestine", "start": 295.44, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "based on the 1967 borders with East", "start": 298.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Jerusalem as its capital.", "start": 301.199, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Without justice for the Palestinian", "start": 304.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "people, there can be no lasting peace.", "start": 305.919, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "This remains a defining test of the", "start": 310.08, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "credibility of the United Nations and", "start": 312.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "particularly the Security Council.", "start": 314.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "And the conflict is no longer confined", "start": 318.32, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "to Palestine. Its consequences are now", "start": 320.24, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "spreading across the region.", "start": 323.68, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "In neighboring Lebanon, United Nations", "start": 326.639, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "peacekeepers have also lost their lives", "start": 328.88, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "while serving the cause of peace.", "start": 331.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "It is in this wider context that Bruno", "start": 334.56, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Salam co-sponsored security council", "start": 337.12, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "resolution 2823 strengthening", "start": 338.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "accountability for crimes against United", "start": 341.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Nations peacekeepers.", "start": 344.0, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Those who serve under the United Nations", "start": 346.639, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "flag must be protected.", "start": 348.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "But accountability cannot be episodic.", "start": 351.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "The protection of those who serve peace", "start": 354.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "and the protection of innocent lives,", "start": 356.8, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "especially children, must remain at the", "start": 359.28, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "heart of this organization.", "start": 361.84, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "Mr. President, rebuilding confidence", "start": 365.6, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "does not mean returning to a world that", "start": 368.319, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "no longer exists. It means equipping", "start": 370.479, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "ourselves to face the world that is", "start": 373.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "emerging. From conflicts and climate", "start": 375.12, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "change to sustainable development and", "start": 377.84, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "emerging technologies,", "start": 380.639, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "the challenges before us are", "start": 383.039, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "increasingly complex and interconnected.", "start": 384.4, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Transformation is already taking place.", "start": 388.0, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "We must ensure it strengthens", "start": 390.4, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "cooperation rather than deepens", "start": 392.319, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "division.", "start": 394.8, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "In Southeast Asia, Azen offers a", "start": 397.199, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "practical example of how these", "start": 399.919, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "principles can be applied at the", "start": 402.319, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "regional level.", "start": 404.24, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Despite our differences, Azan has chosen", "start": 405.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "dialogue, restraint, and continued", "start": 408.56, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "engagement.", "start": 411.28, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "This year marks the 50th anniversary of", "start": 413.199, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "the Treaty of Amity and cooperation in", "start": 415.52, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Southeast Asia or the TAC.", "start": 418.24, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "The TAC gives regional expression to the", "start": 421.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "same fundamental principles found in the", "start": 424.319, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "United Nations Charter. respect for", "start": 426.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "sovereignty, peaceful sediments of", "start": 428.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "disputes, non-inference, and cooperation", "start": 430.88, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "among states.", "start": 434.639, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "In this sense, the TAC does not stand", "start": 437.12, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "apart from the multilateral system. It", "start": 439.52, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "reinforces it.", "start": 441.919, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Azen's experience shows that", "start": 444.0, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "institutions remain relevant when rules", "start": 445.599, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "are respected, dialogue stays open, and", "start": 448.0, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "differences are managed peacefully. The", "start": 451.599, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "same must be true for the United", "start": 454.319, "duration": 3.201}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 456.0, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Reform must not become an exercise in", "start": 457.52, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "rearranging structures while confidence", "start": 459.84, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "outside this hall continues to erode.", "start": 462.479, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Transformation must strengthen the", "start": 466.88, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "United Nations ability to prevent", "start": 468.319, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "crisis, respond effectively to member", "start": 470.4, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "states, and deliver outcomes that make a", "start": 473.12, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "meaningful difference to people's lives.", "start": 475.84, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "Bernardam therefore supports initiatives", "start": 479.919, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "such as the pact of the future and the", "start": 482.16, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "UNAT initiative. Ultimately, reform must", "start": 484.319, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "achieve more than efficiency. It must", "start": 488.639, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "strengthen this organization's", "start": 491.28, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "credibility and its capacity to deliver.", "start": 492.879, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 496.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "a United Nations that delivers for all", "start": 498.879, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "must ultimately deliver for the people.", "start": 501.52, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "That is the spirit of the 2030 agenda", "start": 504.8, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "for sustainable development.", "start": 507.599, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "At its heart is a simple promise that", "start": 510.08, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "progress today should not come at the", "start": 512.399, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "expense of tomorrow.", "start": 515.039, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "For Brunam, preparing for the future", "start": 517.519, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "begins with our people.", "start": 520.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "This lies at the core of Brunai vision", "start": 523.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "2035. Built upon three mutually", "start": 525.6, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "reinforcing goals. An educated, highly", "start": 529.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "skilled and accomplished people, a high", "start": 532.48, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "quality of life and a dynamic and", "start": 535.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "sustainable economy. Together,", "start": 538.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "these goals reflect our conviction that", "start": 541.2, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "national progress cannot be measured by", "start": 543.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "economic growth alone.", "start": 546.08, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "A country is strong when its people are", "start": 549.04, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "strong. That means equipping our people", "start": 551.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "with the knowledge and skills to adapt", "start": 554.56, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "to change. It also means ensuring they", "start": 557.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "have the security and stability to build", "start": 560.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "their lives with confidence supported by", "start": 562.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "strong communities, quality healthcare", "start": 565.04, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "and essential services, social", "start": 567.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "protection and a cohesive resilient", "start": 570.24, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "society.", "start": 573.04, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "For BrunA, stability and development go", "start": 575.04, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "hand in hand.", "start": 578.399, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "Stability gives people the confidence to", "start": 580.959, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "plan for tomorrow and development gives", "start": 582.88, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "them the opportunity to build that", "start": 585.44, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "tomorrow.", "start": 587.839, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Both must be sustained by a dynamic,", "start": 589.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "diversified and resilient economy that", "start": 592.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "creates meaningful opportunities and", "start": 595.68, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "quality employment. Together they create", "start": 597.839, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "the conditions in which people can", "start": 601.519, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "realize their full potential. Our", "start": 603.6, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "ambition is therefore not merely to", "start": 607.44, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "build a more prosperous country, but a", "start": 609.04, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "society in which people feel secure in", "start": 611.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "the present, confident about the future,", "start": 613.44, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "and equipped to shape that future for", "start": 616.32, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "themselves.", "start": 618.48, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "But progress loses its meaning when", "start": 620.32, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "people feel less secure, less included,", "start": 622.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "or less hopeful about what lies ahead.", "start": 625.36, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "That is why no one left behind must be", "start": 629.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "more than a phrase.", "start": 631.839, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "It must be reflected in the choices we", "start": 633.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "make and in the outcomes we deliver.", "start": 636.079, "duration": 6.801}, {"text": "Mr. President, the realities before us", "start": 639.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "are complex, but the principles that", "start": 642.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "should guide us remain clear.", "start": 645.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Confidence in the international system", "start": 648.16, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "is strengthened when promises are kept.", "start": 650.24, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "when international law is applied", "start": 654.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "equally, when dialogue is chosen over", "start": 656.16, "duration": 7.679}, {"text": "force, when sovereignty is respected,", "start": 659.92, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "and when every nation, large or small,", "start": 663.839, "duration": 6.721}, {"text": "knows that its voice matters.", "start": 667.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Therefore, to build the United Nations", "start": 670.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "that delivers for all,", "start": 672.8, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "we must always remember who all means,", "start": 675.36, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "not institutions, not statistics. It is", "start": 679.2, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the people.", "start": 682.88, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "The United Nations we build today will", "start": 684.64, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "shape the world the next generation", "start": 686.88, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "inherits.", "start": 688.48, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "We owe them a world in which cooperation", "start": 690.399, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "remains stronger than conflict. Where", "start": 693.12, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "dialogue remains preferable to", "start": 695.68, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "confrontation,", "start": 698.079, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "where international law does not bend", "start": 699.839, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "according to size or strength, and where", "start": 702.56, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "justice is not determined by power.", "start": 705.839, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "The world does not need another pro", "start": 709.68, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "promise that we failed to keep. It needs", "start": 711.279, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "us to honor the promises we have already", "start": 714.64, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "made.", "start": 717.68, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "That is how credibility is restored.", "start": 719.44, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "That is how multilateralism and", "start": 722.079, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "international law remain relevant. And", "start": 724.079, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "that is how we build a United Nations", "start": 726.88, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "that truly delivers for all. Brunam is", "start": 729.92, "duration": 9.359}, {"text": "ready to play its part. Thank you.", "start": 734.399, "duration": 8.321}, {"text": "I thank the Minister of Foreign Affairs", "start": 739.279, "duration": 7.481}, {"text": "of Brun Jerusalem.", "start": 742.72, "duration": 4.04}]